  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civic oversight and integrity for Ukraine&apos;s resilience and recvoery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A transparent, accountable and corruption-resilient reconstruction in Ukraine, where public institutions, responsible businesses, and active civil society work together to ensure that recovery resources are used efficiently, fairly, and with integrity.

This project aims to achieve a more accountable and transparent reconstruction in Ukraine by conducting civic oversight over the funds use and providing expert support to the government, enhancing business integrity and compliance among SMEs, safeguarding independent and effective anti-corruption institutions, advancing transparent and accountable public investment management.</narrative>
  </description>
